// FIXTURE — must be caught by PINE055
//
// TradingView: Undeclared identifier "targetReached" / "Variable
// "targetScored" is not found in scope ..., cannot register side effect"
//
// The counters were declared with the drawing pools, below the tracking block
// that increments them. Pine resolves identifiers textually EVERYWHERE, not
// only inside functions — which is why PINE055 missed it: the rule only
// walked function bodies, and this read sits in a top-level `if`.
//@version=6
indicator("Forward Global In Block", overlay=true)

if barstate.isconfirmed
    if close > open
        targetReached += 1

var int targetReached = 0
plot(targetReached, title="C")
